# Classic edition (opening-flags): New Game, the vanilla intro to "Right then!", then control in Jian's room
# with 0xC and 0xD set. Saves the state classic_control (same --out for editions_classic_npcs.plan), then
# pin-warps to Fountain Square (map 164) through the room's door and lists the field objects: Lucia (object
